<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-WORLD YOUTH CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WORLD YOUTH CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the world youth soccer championship on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Alor Setar: Ghana 2 Ireland 1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ghana -- Bashiru Gambo 28, Mohamed-Kamil Mouktar 67</p>
<p>Ireland -- Trevor Molloy 52  </p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>In Kuching: South Africa 0 South Korea 0  </p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>In Shah Alam: Uruguay 3 Belgium 0 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Podesta 40, Coelho 55, 77</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>In Kuching: Brazil 3 France 0 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Alex DeSouza 5, Adailton Martins 61, Michel Silvestre 90 own goal</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Alor Star: United States 1 China 0 (0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Brian West 90</p>
